  <div class="split" style="grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:60px;align-items:center">
    <div>
      <h1 class="disp hero-h" style="font-size:clamp(44px,6.4vw,92px);margin:0 0 30px">Shopify speed optimization: a fast website, especially on phones.</h1>
      <p class="p" style="font-size:20px;max-width:580px;margin:0 0 38px">Shoppers leave slow pages before they see the product. We measure real speed, fix the heaviest problems first, and check the results.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-red">Get a free analysis &rarr;</a></div>
    </div>
