</form></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="wrap split" style="gap:80px">
  <div><p class="label red" style="margin:0 0 20px">Does this sound like you?</p><h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);margin:0">Signs it's time to work on the website.</h2></div>
  <div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">01</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Pages take several seconds to show on a phone.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">02</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Large images and scripts slow every page down.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">03</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Visitors leave slow pages before they see the product.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">04</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Speed scores are low, but nobody knows what to fix first.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="label red" style="margin:0 0 20px">How we work</p>
  <h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);margin:0 0 56px;max-width:820px">Review, plan, then price. In that order.</h2>
  <div class="g3"><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 01</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Measure</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">We test real pages on phones and desktops, not only a lab score.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 02</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Fix</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">The heaviest things first: images, scripts and apps that slow every page.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 03</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Recheck</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">We retest and agree a simple way to keep the site fast after changes.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="narrow">
  <div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:50px">
    <p class="label red" style="margin:0 0 18px">What changes</p>
    <p class="p" style="font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 18px">Pages that load the important content first, on the devices your customers actually use.</p>
    <a href="/web-development" class="label red">See how we work &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section data-expansion style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="narrow">
<h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);margin:0 0 28px;max-width:860px">How we make your store fast, especially on phones</h2>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">Speed affects whether shoppers stay long enough to buy, and it affects search. Most slow stores have a few heavy problems, not a hundred small ones. We find those problems and fix them in order of impact.</p>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">What we measure</p>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">We test real pages on phones and desktops, using the same tools search engines use. We look at how quickly the main content appears, how soon the page responds to a tap and whether the layout stays still while it loads.</p>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">What we usually fix</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 26px;padding-left:22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink2)"><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Product images that are too large or not sized for the screen they appear on.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Scripts and apps that run on every page, even where they're not needed.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Fonts and animations that delay the main content.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Theme code that loads more than the page uses.</li></ul>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">How we keep it fast</p>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">Speed slips over time as new apps and tracking tools are added. We agree a simple rule: nothing goes live that makes the main product pages slower. We also re-check speed on a regular schedule, which is part of our upkeep service.</p>
<h3 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(32px,3.6vw,44px);margin:56px 0 24px">Frequently asked questions</h3>
<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink);margin:0 0 20px"><details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0"><summary style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer">Will speed fixes change our design?</summary><p class="p" style="margin:14px 0 0">Usually very little. Most of the work happens behind the scenes, in images, scripts and code.</p></details><details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0"><summary style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer">Can you make a slow store fast in a week?</summary><p class="p" style="margin:14px 0 0">Some of the biggest gains, such as image fixes, can be quick. Other problems take longer, and we'll tell you which is which before we start.</p></details></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="wrap">
  <div style="background:var(--red);color:#fff;border-radius:36px;padding:clamp(60px,8vw,100px) clamp(24px,5vw,60px)">
    <h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,88px);margin:0 0 26px;max-width:900px">Not sure what your site needs?</h2>
    <p style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;max-width:560px;margin:0 0 36px;color:#FBE3E0">Tell us what isn't working. On a 30-minute call we'll review the site and agree a plan before anything is priced.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background:var(--ink);color:#fff">Book a free call &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
